  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development, by virtue of the facilities provided within the building, the independent front access via Elmcroft Avenue, subdivision of rear garden, and lack of integration between the annexe and the existing dwelling, cannot be considered to be ancillary to the main dwelling and it would form a separate and distinct independent unit of accommodation.  As such, the new dwelling would provide a poor level of accommodation and detract from the established pattern of development in the area to the detriment of the character of the area.  The proposal therefore would be contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D4 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP30 of the Core Strategy (2010) and Policies DMD6, DMD7, DMD8, DMD12 and DMD37 of the Development Management Document (2014)."
